---
import Shot from './Shot.astro';

const skins = [
  { id: 'system', name: 'System', x: 98 },
  { id: 'classic', name: 'Classic', x: 258 },
  { id: 'dart', name: 'Dart', x: 419 },
  { id: 'bolt', name: 'Bolt', x: 580 },
  { id: 'ring', name: 'Ring', x: 740 },
  { id: 'target', name: 'Target', x: 900 },
  { id: 'star', name: 'Star', x: 1061 },
  { id: 'heart', name: 'Heart', x: 1221 },
  { id: 'ghost', name: 'Ghost', x: 1382 },
];
---
<section class="section scenes" id="scenes" aria-labelledby="scenes-title" data-surface="dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="scenes-top">
      <h2 id="scenes-title" class="h2" data-reveal>One look per situation.</h2>
      <p class="scenes-say" data-reveal>
        <strong>Stream</strong> is big and bright. <strong>Meeting</strong> is quiet. <strong>Recording</strong> keeps the ripples and the ink on.
        Make your own, or start from Teaching, Webinar, Tutorial, Pairing or High visibility.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="collage" data-reveal>
      <figure class="panel panel-rules">
        <Shot id="app-rules" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 520px, 80vw" widths={[640, 1320]} />
      </figure>
      <figure class="panel panel-strip">
        <Shot id="scene-strip" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 640px, 92vw" widths={[640, 1050]} />
      </figure>
      <p class="collage-note">
        Pick a scene for an app, or for a whole kind of app, such as calls, slides, code or video. When it comes to the front, its scene is on.
        A shortcut steps to the next scene by hand, and scenes can be reordered, duplicated, renamed, exported and imported.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="skins" data-skins>
      <div class="skins-head">
        <h2 class="h2" data-reveal>Or swap the pointer itself.</h2>
        <p class="lead" data-reveal>
          A scene can replace the real pointer with a skin, in its own color and size.{' '}
          <span class="only-live">Click one below: it is your pointer on this page until you press Escape.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="skins-panel" data-reveal>
        <Shot id="skins-row" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 92vw" widths={[640, 1000, 1480]} />
        <div class="skin-hits" role="group" aria-label="Pointer skins">
          {skins.map((s) => (
            <button type="button" class="skin-hit" data-skin-pick={s.id} aria-pressed="false" style={`left:${((s.x - 20) / 1480) * 100}%`}>
              <span class="sr-only">{s.name}</span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
